  "translatedBlocks": 30,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "727ce47785e07b44",
      "translationZh": "摘要：ScreenEnv 是一个功能强大的 Python 库，可让你在 Docker 容器中创建隔离的 Ubuntu 桌面环境，用于测试和部署 GUI 智能体（也称为 Computer Use 智能体）。借助对模型上下文协议（MCP）的内置支持，部署能够查看、点击并与真实应用程序交互的桌面智能体变得前所未有地简单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "eab952c9f1b08150",
      "translationZh": "什么是 ScreenEnv？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60efe93a97dc6328",
      "translationZh": "想象一下，你需要自动执行桌面任务、测试 GUI 应用程序，或构建一个能与软件交互的 AI 智能体。过去，这需要复杂的虚拟机配置和脆弱的自动化框架。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8cadc0fb8251a3bc",
      "translationZh": "ScreenEnv 通过提供在 Docker 容器中运行的沙箱化桌面环境，改变了这一状况。你可以将它视为一个完整的虚拟桌面会话，由你的代码全权控制——不仅能点击按钮和输入文本，还能管理整个桌面使用过程，包括启动应用程序、整理窗口、处理文件、执行终端命令，以及录制整个会话。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d2e8a55772b4ea63",
      "translationZh": "为什么选择 ScreenEnv？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bee13acb3bbf9dfe",
      "translationZh": "🖥️ 全面桌面控制：完整的鼠标和键盘自动化、窗口管理、应用程序启动、文件操作、终端访问以及屏幕录制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "39756a9f509969f1",
      "translationZh": "🤖 双重集成模式：既支持面向 AI 系统的模型上下文协议（MCP），也支持直接使用 Sandbox API——可适配任何智能体或后端逻辑",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d75f38372cd47e50",
      "translationZh": "🐳 Docker 原生：无需复杂的虚拟机配置，只需 Docker。环境相互隔离、可复现，并且可在不到 10 秒内轻松部署到任何地方。支持 AMD64 和 ARM64 架构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f264dcccb851580f",
      "translationZh": "🎯 一行完成设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ac47aed80fab3a36",
      "translationZh": "两种集成方式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5390c5250246625",
      "translationZh": "ScreenEnv 提供了两种互补的方式，可与你的智能体和后端系统集成，让你能够灵活选择最适合自身架构的方式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b230a7c0665aebe9",
      "translationZh": "方案 1：直接使用沙箱 API",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "233d92f5be7913ba",
      "translationZh": "非常适合自定义智能体框架、现有后端，或需要精细控制的场景：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7357a512c9c6d9f8",
      "translationZh": "方案 2：MCP 服务器集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4302871b2655aa16",
      "translationZh": "非常适合支持模型上下文协议的 AI 系统：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3358360d98bb3f23",
      "translationZh": "这种双重方式意味着，ScreenEnv 能适应你现有的基础设施，而不是迫使你改变智能体架构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "de00672d16de4316",
      "translationZh": "✨ 使用 screenenv 和 smolagents 创建桌面智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c18f9658faa62c25",
      "translationZh": "screenenv 原生支持 smolagents，让你能够轻松构建自己的自定义桌面智能体，用于自动化。只需几个步骤，即可创建由 AI 驱动的桌面智能体：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6eda39815d600fea",
      "translationZh": "1. 选择模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be4ab156aca22f14",
      "translationZh": "选择你希望用来驱动智能体的后端视觉语言模型（VLM）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1d4dd493445f5da1",
      "translationZh": "2. 定义自定义桌面智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb5bc16e4a7e2bbd",
      "translationZh": "继承 DesktopAgentBase 并实现 _setup_desktop_tools 方法，构建你自己的动作空间！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "97728550c712203a",
      "translationZh": "3. 运行智能体执行桌面任务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16575481126dc704",
      "translationZh": "如果遇到 docker 访问被拒绝的错误，可以尝试使用 sudo -E python -m test.py 运行智能体，或将你的用户添加到 docker 组。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eca1b8813f34c727",
      "translationZh": "💡 如需了解完整实现，请参阅 GitHub 上的这份 CustomDesktopAgent 源码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c4756410b23b9cb3",
      "translationZh": "立即开始",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "470e89354bef3017",
      "translationZh": "下一步是什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62e495d09155bc93",
      "translationZh": "ScreenEnv 旨在将支持范围从 Linux 扩展至 Android、macOS 和 Windows，实现真正的跨平台 GUI 自动化。这将使开发者和研究人员能够以极少的配置，构建可跨环境泛化的智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "508c8c67074321ed",
      "translationZh": "这些进展为创建可复现的沙箱化环境铺平了道路，这类环境非常适合用于基准测试和评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f745674d28db1450",
      "translationZh": "代码仓库：https://github.com/huggingface/screenenv",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
